,"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":53,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I edited the network and all three files are in `work/`, but I couldn't measure the effect (no simulator), so the expected improvement is only about 0.2–0.5% and could be lost in noise.\n\n**What I changed and why:** The trained network almost always switches at the 12 s minimum green, so its only real decision is which phase to serve next. That choice is sensible overall but noisy when two options score nearly the same: about 12% of decisions flip when the junction is mirrored N↔S, E↔W. In the recorded data, the network's close calls that went against a simple rule did worse. The rule ranks each phase by its waiting vehicles minus 5 s × its arrival rate. So I added a capped nudge to the outputs: 0.75 logit per waiting vehicle, at most ±2.5 per comparison. It is built from three repurposed layer-1 units and three layer-2 units, set by hand.\n\n**Parameters changed:** exactly 371 of 7428, which is the limit, confirmed on the saved file.\n\n**Checks:**\n- About 6% of honoured decisions change; 89% of those move to a phase with more waiting vehicles.\n- The original network held its current green 71 times on its own recorded runs; now 44 times.\n- Mirror disagreement drops from 12.3% to 10.1%.\n- Hand-made test states (full pockets, long queues, empty junction) give the same choices as before.\n- All outputs are finite.\n\n**Test predictions (veh-h):** low 34.4, nominal 44.4, high 54.2.","ttft_ms":1662,"type":"result","duration_ms":1504385,"uuid":"25f1d4f8-7cd4-42b2-84b3-f51aca9235fd","ttft_stream_ms":968,"time_to_request_ms":46,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":3,"system_prompt":6,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":1,"input_attachments":7,"input_hooks":1,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":3,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":3,"init_frame_send":1,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":2,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":4,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":4,"message_normalization":1,"client_creation":1,"request_build":5},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":0,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":71,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"deferred_tools_delta","slowest_producer_ms":3,"cpu_ms":12,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":2,"ambient_wait_ms":2,"render_ms":0,"producers":43,"token_counts":0},"tool_schema_build_detail":{"betas_ms":0,"waits_ms":1,"placement_ms":0,"render_ms":3,"after_ms":0,"other_ms":0,"tools":14,"new_schemas":14},"message_normalization_detail":{"before_ms":0,"normalize_ms":1,"images_ms":0,"post_process_ms":0,"after_ms":0,"other_ms":0,"messages":12,"wire_messages":2},"request_build_detail":{"records_ms":0,"system_ms":0,"headers_ms":1,"cache_break_record_ms":0,"plans_ms":1,"retry_setup_ms":0,"sent_build_ms":1,"record_attempt_ms":2,"other_ms":0,"sent_build_safety_context_ms":0,"sent_build_cache_breakpoints_ms":0,"sent_build_surrogate_scan_ms":0},"first_content_frame_ms":968,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-02T07:15:00.587Z"}
